# Rust
tui/target/
# Workspace build dir created by the root Cargo.toml (slice 2 of the
# persistent-host-daemon design doc moved tui to a workspace member).
# No trailing slash: target is a symlink to the shared build dir
# (~/.cm/shared-target, see .cargo/config.toml), and `/target/` only
# matches real directories.
/target
